flowchart TD
    A(["Start: vector-db-pre-filtering_*.py"]) --> B["Load one JSON file:<br/>13 docs + role_policy + 4 cases"]
    B --> C["embed() each doc and add to ChromaDB<br/>metadata: tenant_id · allowed_role · classification"]

    C --> D1
